sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant PostResource
    participant PostService
    participant JPA
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Post
    participant Author
    participant Jackson

    Client->>PostResource: GET /posts/{id}
    Note over Client,PostResource: Client requests Post by ID
    
    activate PostResource
    PostResource->>PostService: findById(id)
    activate PostService
    
    PostService->>JPA: find(Post.class, id)
    Note over PostService,JPA: JPA queries PostgreSQL database
    activate JPA
    
    JPA->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM post WHERE id = ?
    activate PostgreSQL
    PostgreSQL-->>JPA: return post row with author_id
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    
    JPA->>Post: instantiate Post
    activate Post
    deactivate Post
    
    JPA->>Author: load Author by author_id
    Note over JPA,Author: Post entity is loaded with Author relationship
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    
    JPA-->>PostService: return Post
    deactivate JPA
    
    PostService-->>PostResource: return post
    deactivate PostService
    
    PostResource->>Jackson: serialize(post)
    Note over PostResource,Jackson: Jackson serializes Post to JSON with JsonManagedReference
    activate Jackson
    
    Jackson->>Post: getId(), getTitle(), getContent()
    activate Post
    deactivate Post
    
    Jackson->>Post: getAuthor()
    Note over Jackson,Post: Apply JsonManagedReference to serialize author
    activate Post
    deactivate Post
    
    Jackson->>Author: getId(), getName(), getEmail()
    activate Author
    deactivate Author
    
    Jackson-->>PostResource: JSON serialized Post
    deactivate Jackson
    
    PostResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.ok(jsonPost)
    Note over PostResource,Client: JSON response is returned to client with HTTP 200
    deactivate PostResource